cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Racing Setup Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A case-centric vehicle-dynamics workspace that predicts handling balance, sizes
  spring / ARB / damper numbers, simulates a tyre stint, and — with real telemetry
  and a verified calibration — reports honestly-gated measured metrics. Every value
  is labelled by how it was derived (Physics / Model / Measured / Derived / Heuristic
  / Unavailable) and every blocked feature states why. Local-first, trilingual
  (English / 繁體中文 / 日本語). Not a professional race-engineer replacement,
  a full MBD simulator, a complete tyre model, or a GPS racing-line tool.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: SKYLINE
version: "2.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/USADA-KARROT/racing-setup-analyzer"
